{"5006370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The First Stranger", "steam_appid": 5006370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future of 2033, you will play Zhou Xuan, a former psychologist. To uncover the truth behind your girlfriend's disappearance, you must use money to buy clues before the 100-day countdown ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔪Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase and fight in a gravity-distorted, <strong>Weirdcore</strong> aesthetic subspace, while listening to the pasts and true thoughts of various NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/17f3e90237cbfb36815529f3439760ca.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/17f3e90237cbfb36815529f3439760ca.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/17f3e90237cbfb36815529f3439760ca.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/30f9e418f3af68636c01ea311cee6437.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/30f9e418f3af68636c01ea311cee6437.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/30f9e418f3af68636c01ea311cee6437.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬Social</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter NPCs with distinct personalities, develop relationships with them, and advance the storyline.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/e14f30444ea2e75a09af04bc6c943665.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/e14f30444ea2e75a09af04bc6c943665.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/e14f30444ea2e75a09af04bc6c943665.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰Trading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read daily news or get insider tips from NPCs and passersby to make money in the stock market. The game's trading system simulates the popular and exciting T+1 trading style. You operate in a market where you can only go long, within a few fixed time slots each day. You can only check the stock price changes and profit/loss results in the next time slot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/b5f944a970374f3995a8dca60c9a0a6d.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/b5f944a970374f3995a8dca60c9a0a6d.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/b5f944a970374f3995a8dca60c9a0a6d.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future of 2033, you will play Zhou Xuan, a former psychologist. To uncover the truth behind your girlfriend's disappearance, you must use money to buy clues before the 100-day countdown ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔪Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase and fight in a gravity-distorted, <strong>Weirdcore</strong> aesthetic subspace, while listening to the pasts and true thoughts of various NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/17f3e90237cbfb36815529f3439760ca.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/17f3e90237cbfb36815529f3439760ca.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/17f3e90237cbfb36815529f3439760ca.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/30f9e418f3af68636c01ea311cee6437.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/30f9e418f3af68636c01ea311cee6437.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/30f9e418f3af68636c01ea311cee6437.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬Social</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter NPCs with distinct personalities, develop relationships with them, and advance the storyline.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/e14f30444ea2e75a09af04bc6c943665.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/e14f30444ea2e75a09af04bc6c943665.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/e14f30444ea2e75a09af04bc6c943665.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰Trading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read daily news or get insider tips from NPCs and passersby to make money in the stock market. The game's trading system simulates the popular and exciting T+1 trading style. You operate in a market where you can only go long, within a few fixed time slots each day. You can only check the stock price changes and profit/loss results in the next time slot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/b5f944a970374f3995a8dca60c9a0a6d.poster.avif?t=1787549662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/b5f944a970374f3995a8dca60c9a0a6d.webm?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006370/extras/b5f944a970374f3995a8dca60c9a0a6d.mp4?t=1787549662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The First Stranger is a psychological thriller RPG. Investigate your missing girlfriend and uncover the hidden sides of those around you. Experience a unique blend of visual novel storytelling and grotesque combat, while trading stocks to earn money and buy clues on your journey toward the truth.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app